rpc: ScanGetApNum resp=0 number=11
rpc: ScanGetApRecords tx pb=12 tlv=24
rpc: ScanGetApRecords pb bytes: 08 01 10 a1 02 18 09 8a 12 02 08 0a
nsh> 
